1211 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Ability Scores\056 Your Dexterity Score increases by 1\056\nJungle Orc Weaponry\056 You have proficiency with the club\054 greatclub\054 and scimitar\056\nHigh Climber\056 You have a climbing speed equal to your walking speed\056)
     /K [ 3 ]
     /P 1212 0 R
     /Pg 1202 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
