1215 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The Plains Orc are a nomadic people\054 always seeking to explore new lands and travel the world\056 While sometimes they prefer to travel alone\054 it is most common to see a group of 2 to 4 Plains Orcs travelling together alongside a flock of sheep\054 goats\054 or other pack animal\056\n\nThose Plains Orcs who do establish a more permanent home will often do so only with the intent to build a farm\054 ranch\054 or preserve\056 Many of the produce in Pliara comes from Plains Orc ranches and farms\056 They are known herd livestock of all types and primarily eat meat\056 Utilizing every part of the animals they kill\054 these Orcs are often seen dressed in tanned hides or leathers\056 To the Plains Orcs\054 every kill is to be worshipped as a gift\054 and taking a life from the world must be done responsibly\056\n\nPlains Orcs are\054 for the most part\054 the calmest and most spiritually enlightened of the Orc sub\055races\056 Most Plains Orcs worship Plii herself\054 while others worship Arnyss Torunn\056 Many Plains Orcs lean towards a Neutral Alignment while leaning towards a more Druidic or Monk lifestyle\073 however\054 many Plains Orcs are known to learn a wide array of skills as artisans as well\056)
     /K [ 5 ]
     /P 1216 0 R
     /Pg 1202 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

