  << /ActualText (Ability Scores\056 Your Wisdom Score increases by 1\056\nShepherd\056 You have advantage on Animal Handling skill checks\056\nForecast\056 You gain proficiency in the Survival skill\056 Once per long rest\054 you can predict the weather for the next 12 hours within a 5 miles radius with 90 percent accuracy\056 Magical alterations to the weather are not taken into consideration and are not predictable in this way\056)
     /K [ 7 ]
     /P 1220 0 R
