1221 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Pliaran Orcs embody the raw\054 untamed forces of nature\054 standing as the largest and most physically formidable of their kin\056 Reaching heights between seven and eight feet tall\054 these imposing beings make their homes within the deep caves and scattered camps across the sun\055drenched\054 warmer regions of Pliara\056 Their towering frames\054 heavy builds\054 and prominent tusks give them an unmistakable presence that dominates any landscape they inhabit\056\n\nUnlike their nomadic or canopy\055dwelling relatives\054 Pliaran Orcs are defined by a fierce\054 unrelenting lifestyle rooted in survival and physical power\056 They excel in tests of brute force\054 leaning into an aggressive\054 unpredictable nature that sets them apart from other Orcish societies\056 This relentless strength drives their culture\054 making them legendary figures whose sheer presence Commands respect and caution throughout the realm\056\n\nTales of their brutality and power echo across every corner of Pliara\054 giving rise to countless stories and myths that shape how other races view them\056 Whether occupying rugged territories or defending their territory from outsiders\054 Pliaran Orcs remain a dominant and unyielding force\054 forever tied to the harsh\054 sun\055baked environments they call home\056)
     /K [ 8 ]
     /P 1222 0 R
     /Pg 1202 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

