1223 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Ability Scores\056 Your Constitution Score increases by 1\056\nAggression\056 As a bonus action\054 you can move up to your speed toward an enemy of your choice that you can see or hear\056 You must end this move closer to the enemy than you started\056\nSkills for the Clan\056 You gain proficiency with any one skill and any one tool of your choice\056)
     /K [ 9 ]
