1231 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Ability Scores\056 Your Strength Score increases by 2\056\nAge\056 Orcs mature a little faster than humans\054 reaching adulthood around age 12\056 They live to be about 85 years old\056\nAlignment\056 Orcish cultures tend toward a live\055and\055let\055live worldview\056 People raised among orcs are not as often lawful\054 tending instead toward a more relaxed attitude\056 Orcish disposition versus good and evil varies wildly based on the sub\055race of Orc\056\nSize\056 Orcs are somewhat larger and bulkier than humans\054 and they range from 5 to 8 feet tall\054 depending on sub\055race\056 Your average Pliaran Orc will stand between 7 and 8 feet tall\054 for example\054 while a Jungle Orc may only grow to be 5 feet tall\056 Either way\054 your size is Medium\056\nSpeed\056 Your base walking speed is 30 feet\056\nDarkvision\056 You can see in dim light within 60 feet of you as if it were bright light\054 and in darkness as if it were dim light\056 You cannot discern color in darkness\054 only shades of gray\056\nLanguages\056 You can speak\054 read\054 and write Common and Orcish\056\nRelentless Endurance\056 When you are reduced to 0 hit points but not killed outright\054 you can drop to 1 hit point instead\056 You can\031t use this feature again until you finish a long rest\056\nIntimidating Appearance\056 You have proficiency in the Intimidation skill\056)
     /K [ 3 ]
     /P 1232 0 R
     /Pg 1204 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

